<title>USA: Audiovox to buy back up to 1.0 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Audiovox to buy back up to 1.0 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>HAUPPAUGE, N.Y. 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audiovox Corp said Friday its board of directors had authorized the repurchase of up to one million shares of its Class A common stock.</p>
<p>The company, which has more than 18 million fully diluted shares, distributes cellular telephones, among other things.</p>
